# Base URL the BROWSER uses for API calls — used by `npm run build`. Kept
# relative so requests hit this app's own Vercel origin and get proxied to
# the real backend by vercel.json's rewrite. This must stay same-origin (not
# point at the Render backend directly): the backend's session cookie is
# cross-site (`SameSite=None`) and some mobile browsers (notably iOS Safari)
# block cross-site cookies outright, so a direct Render URL here silently
# breaks login on those browsers even though the login request itself
# succeeds. See lib/api.ts.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
